    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/17ec6f68107535523f32a993b8abe596.avif?t=1754054634\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/2737745e566399e0574c00974c5a94c9.poster.avif?t=1754054634\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/2737745e566399e0574c00974c5a94c9.webm?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/2737745e566399e0574c00974c5a94c9.mp4?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knight Jump - 60 Minutes to Hell and Back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D precision platformer, but you only got 60 minutes. Inspired by the classic skill (frustration) games like &quot;Jump King&quot; or &quot;Only Up&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't adjust midair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fail: Your safe file gets deleted!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/740d0fec8a6f5b4e5c70ea5adcadfc4c.avif?t=1754054634\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/c68b56ddc9eb956fd52147f09e137473.poster.avif?t=1754054634\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/c68b56ddc9eb956fd52147f09e137473.webm?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/c68b56ddc9eb956fd52147f09e137473.mp4?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't be easy, because the Horrors of the depth are chasing you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump out of Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't die (Pro Advice)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/45cd1f5546ec47c2bfbe2712d32de31f.avif?t=1754054634\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/8e5076110d172288189fccb850feb547.poster.avif?t=1754054634\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/8e5076110d172288189fccb850feb547.webm?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/8e5076110d172288189fccb850feb547.mp4?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse different worlds until you reach the princess!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different levels. One harder than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/433ed5f80027b290f3cac85be5a4c157.poster.avif?t=1754054634\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/433ed5f80027b290f3cac85be5a4c157.webm?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/433ed5f80027b290f3cac85be5a4c157.mp4?t=1754054634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Have fun with this little (Horror) 3D Plattformer and maybe help me feed my Cat! :)</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/fa8a0a4aefcf2bda84472f15bb910d36.avif?t=1754054634\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
